# Hugging Face downloaded training data + per-row audit CSVs (heavy artifacts, local-only).
# In the main repo, dataset_analysis/data/ and results/ are real directories where
# JSON summaries are tracked but bulky parquets and per-row CSVs are not. The audit
# work branch used these as symlinks to the main repo; that branch's catch-all rules
# are intentionally NOT merged because they would over-ignore the tracked summary
# JSONs and outlier MDs that already exist on master.
dataset_analysis/data/raw/
dataset_analysis/data/**/*.parquet
dataset_analysis/data/**/*.jsonl
dataset_analysis/results/**/*.csv
dataset_analysis/logs/

models/*

/.claude/

